---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {snapshot,pathTo} from '../lib/snapshot';import {renderDocument} from '../lib/document';
---
<Layout title="关于我"><section class="container page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">NICE TO MEET YOU</span><h1>你好，我是 {snapshot.settings.author}<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>这是我的一小块互联网空间。</p></section><section class="container about-layout section-bottom"><aside class="profile-card"><div class="avatar-letter">S<span>✳</span></div><h2>{snapshot.settings.author}</h2><p>学习 / 记录 / 探索</p><a class="text-link" href={snapshot.settings.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在 GitHub 找到我 ↗</a></aside><div><div class="prose" set:html={renderDocument(snapshot.settings.about)}></div><div class="about-note"><h3>为什么写这个博客</h3><p>给学习留下笔记，给日常留下坐标。也希望这里的某一句话，能与你产生一点共鸣。</p><a class="text-link" href={pathTo('guestbook/')}>欢迎来打个招呼 →</a></div></div></section></Layout>
